reagent-name-pinot-mort = Pinot Mort
reagent-desc-pinot-mort = For the crew member who just can't get enough of the ash wastes.

reagent-name-red-queen = Red Queen
reagent-desc-red-queen = A pale, unsettling little potion. The label simply reads: DRINK ME.

reagent-name-blazaam = Blazaam
reagent-desc-blazaam = A strange drink that, curiously, few people seem to remember ordering.

reagent-name-bastion-bourbon = Bastion Bourbon
reagent-desc-bastion-bourbon = A soothing herbal brew with hints of citrus and berry. Said to steady even the shakiest hands.

reagent-name-commander-and-chief = Commander and Chief
reagent-desc-commander-and-chief = An extravagant cocktail built for someone in a hurry to run a station.

reagent-name-fringe-weaver = Fringe Weaver
reagent-desc-fringe-weaver = Bubbly, classy, and undoubtedly strong.

reagent-name-sugar-rush = Sugar Rush
reagent-desc-sugar-rush = Sweet, light, and almost sickly fruity.

reagent-name-crevice-spike = Crevice Spike
reagent-desc-crevice-spike = Sour, bitter, and smashingly sharp. Drink with caution.

reagent-name-squirt-cider = Squirt Cider
reagent-desc-squirt-cider = A fermented cider with a nose of stale bread and salt water. Nobody's quite sure what's actually in it.
